{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "It must be owned, and no one was more ready to confess it than himself, that his literary attainments were by no means of a high order.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["It", " must", " be", " owned", ",", " and", " no", " one", " was", " more", " ready", " to", " confess", " it", " than", " himself", ",", " that", " his", " literary", " attain", "ments", " were", " by", " no", " means", " of", " a", " high", " order", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Would not the loftiest eminences of the city at least be visible?", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Would", " not", " the", " loft", "iest", " em", "in", "ences", " of", " the", " city", " at", " least", " be", " visible", "?"], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "I painted the eyes red for anger.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["I", " painted", " the", " eyes", " red", " for", " anger", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Oh, it is better to live on the sea and let other men raise your crops and cook your meals.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Oh", ",", " it", " is", " better", " to", " live", " on", " the", " sea", " and", " let", " other", " men", " raise", " your", " crops", " and", " cook", " your", " meals", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The farmer sat gloomily on the bench and would not eat, and you cannot wonder, for he saw us putting potfuls of his good beef and bascule loads of bread into our big mouths.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " farmer", " sat", " glo", "om", "ily", " on", " the", " bench", " and", " would", " not", " eat", ",", " and", " you", " cannot", " wonder", ",", " for", " he", " saw", " us", " putting", " pot", "ful", "s", " of", " his", " good", " beef", " and", " b", "asc", "ule", " loads", " of", " bread", " into", " our", " big", " mouths", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "That is the best way to decide. For the spear will always point somewhere, and one thing is as good as another.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["That", " is", " the", " best", " way", " to", " decide", ".", " For", " the", " spear", " will", " always", " point", " somewhere", ",", " and", " one", " thing", " is", " as", " good", " as", " another", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "When I addressed him, he answered constrainedly.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["When", " I", " addressed", " him", ",", " he", " answered", " constrained", "ly", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "You were quite right to say no. Ambrose began, \"Never smoke with John Iago; his cigars will poison you.\"", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["You", " were", " quite", " right", " to", " say", " no", ".", " Amb", "rose", " began", ",", " \"", "Never", " smoke", " with", " John", " I", "ago", ";", " his", " cigars", " will", " poison", " you", ".\""], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Silas slunk away without a word of protest. Ambrose stood his ground, evidently bent on making his peace with Naomi before he left her. Seeing that I was in the way, I walked aside toward a glass door at the lower end of the room.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Sil", "as", " sl", "unk", " away", " without", " a", " word", " of", " protest", ".", " Amb", "rose", " stood", " his", " ground", ",", " evidently", " bent", " on", " making", " his", " peace", " with", " Naomi", " before", " he", " left", " her", ".", " Seeing", " that", " I", " was", " in", " the", " way", ",", " I", " walked", " aside", " toward", " a", " glass", " door", " at", " the", " lower", " end", " of", " the", " room", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "He's not a man for country quarters.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["He", "'s", " not", " a", " man", " for", " country", " quarters", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
